3. Original-language word data (public/bible-data/orig/) - Creative Commons
   Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)
   - STEP Bible (www.STEPBible.org), data created by STEPBible.org based on
     work at Tyndale House Cambridge: https://github.com/STEPBible/STEPBible-Data
     (commit 1f3423d4): TAGNT (Translators Amalgamated Greek NT), TAHOT
     (Translators Amalgamated Hebrew OT), TBESG and TBESH (Translators Brief
     lexicons of Extended Strongs for Greek and Hebrew).
   Changes made (scripts/build-original-words.mjs, ADR-0018): one file per
   chapter; Greek words of the Nestle-Aland text only (a verse with none keeps
   its Traditional-text words); Hebrew accents, punctuation and the "/"
   segment marks removed from the word, transliterations without syllable
   dots and lower-cased; morphology kept for verbs only; lexicon meanings
   shortened to 200 characters with references and scholarly apparatus
   removed; text normalised to Unicode NFC.
   Ask AI credits "STEP Bible", linked to www.STEPBible.org, wherever it
   uses this data.

